    "description": "The US-Iran MoU and the fly in the ointment",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/The-US-Iran-MoU-and-the-fly-in-the-ointment/172-343102",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
