    "description": "Used vehicle prices could rise again after removal of 15% valuation reduction: VIASL",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Used-vehicle-prices-could-rise-again-after-removal-of-15-valuation-reduction-VIASL/108-343124",
