    "chunk_text": "Yoshitha Rajapaksa granted bail\n\nColombo, June 17 (Daily Mirror) - The Colombo Magistrate\u2019s Court today (17) granted bail to Yoshitha Rajapaksa, hours after he was arrested by the Commission to Investigate Allegations of Bribery or Corruption (CIABOC) in connection with an ongoing investigation into his recruitment to the Sri Lanka Navy.\n\nColombo Additional Magistrate Lahiru Silva ordered Rajapaksa\u2019s release on three personal bails of Rs. 5 million each. The court also imposed a travel ban, preventing him from leaving the country pending further proceedings."
  },
