    "md5": "5087057beb2ba6313c0b3c0ddf43ec33",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1690,
    "chunk_text": "Global Vinyl takes Sri Lankan vinyl flooring to Maldives resorts\n\nSri Lankan manufacturer and distributor of vinyl flooring, Global Vinyl Ltd., has begun exporting its products to luxury resorts in the Maldives. The move is part of a broader strategy to take locally produced, SGS-certified vinyl flooring to international markets.\n\nGlobal Vinyl Ltd., Export Manager Winter Alexander observed that the demand for vinyl flooring has risen globally as a modern, technologically advanced alternative to wooden flooring. He noted that luxury villas and resorts, boutiques, offices and even homes are increasingly turning to this option.\n\n\u201cWe are exporting our SPC vinyl flooring to high-end luxury resorts in the Maldives at present. We are also in discussions with other buyers in the region and will soon commence exports to those countries as well,\u201d he said.\n\nAlexander added that vinyl flooring offers the rich appearance of wood without the high cost. \u201cNot only is it aesthetically appealing, but it is also quick to install, easy to remove and replace, more affordable than wood, durable, waterproof, termite-proof and does not require the maintenance associated with traditional wooden flooring,\u201d he said.\n\nHe further explained that the company obtained the SGS certification as part of its commitment to maintaining international standards and building confidence among both local and foreign buyers.\n\nIn recognition of its position as Sri Lanka\u2019s pioneer manufacturer and distributor of vinyl flooring, Global Vinyl Ltd., received an award of excellence for its SPC flooring under the Annual Product Award Scheme conducted by the Sri Lanka Institute of Architects in 2026.\u201d"
  },
