    "description": "Paucity of demanding home consumers and world-class suppliers stymying SL\u2019s global competitiveness",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Paucity-of-demanding-home-consumers-and-world-class-suppliers-stymying-SL-s-global-competitiveness/4-793447",
    "lang": "en",
