    "description": "Japan\u2019s proposal for an Economic Corridor between India and Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Japan-s-proposal-for-an-Economic-Corridor-between-India-and-Sri-Lanka/4-793451",
    "lang": "en",
