    "chunk_text": "On the corporate front, Softlogic Life Insurance announced a strategic regional expansion, entering into a share purchase agreement to acquire a 60% stake in a Dhaka-based life insurer for US$ 1.9 million, marking its foray into the Bangladeshi market. In contrast, trading in Hela Apparel Holdings was suspended effective June 18, 2026, following the company\u2019s failure to rectify a disclaimer of audit opinion in its annual report for the year ended March 2025 \u2013 a regulatory compliance issue that dampened sentiment around the stock.\n\nWhile the day ended with mixed market reactions, the underlying tone driven by the geopolitical relief was quite evident during trading.\n\nLAKARCADE appointed as national entity member of World Crafts Council\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
